          '**Pace and duration** — birding rewards slow travel: fewer lodges, longer stays, less repositioning. That efficiency partially offsets the specialist premium.',
          '**Season** — the November–April birding peak overlaps Tanzania’s green season, when lodge rates are often gentler than the July crowds pay.',
